Abdel,

XML is not a RoSuDa package. Please contact the appropriate mailing  
list or the maintainer (or in fact just read the documentation  
because it is trivial!).

On May 12, 2007, at 6:40 AM, Abdel wrote:

> XML parsing under R / Extracting nodes’ values :
>
> Hi,
> I have an XML file which contains among other nodes :
>
> ===myXMLfile.xml===
> (…)
> <nbRelations>2</nbRelations>
> <nbActors>2</nbActors>
> (...)
> <nbRuns>5</nbRuns>
> <nbStep>2000</nbStep>
> (…)
> ===End file===
