> nbRelations = 2
> nbActors = 2
>
> nbRuns = 5
> nbSteps = 2000
>
> How can I do that using xmlTreeParse() or an other function ?

the (...) are quite important, but assuming this is just wrapped in  
something like <root> ..</root> it would look like

r = xmlRoot(xmlTreeParse(file))
nbRelations = xmlValue(r[["nbRelations"]])
...


Cheers,
Simon

