In 99% of cases this means that you don't have R shared library and  
thus JRI could not be built (just watch the output of the rJava  
installation). Please make sure you have compiled R with --enable-R- 
shlib (if you have a binary version from your Linux distribution,  
make sure you install the R shared library as well).

Cheers,
Simon


